# Code Quality

- Self-explanatory code; comments only for non-obvious **why**.
- Target files under ~300–400 lines; split when clarity improves.
- Organized imports; SOLID without over-engineering.
- Preserve existing comments; don't add obvious inline narration.
- Consider errors, edge cases, and performance; validate inputs; no happy-path-only assumptions.
